127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This report presents the results of the testing process conducted by the Empower Test Team for the 'Guau Guau' Veterinary management system. The primary objective of the testing was to evaluate the quality, functionality, security, and performance of the system. Throughout the different phases of the project, the team has diligently worked to identify and address any issues that could impact the system's integrity and usability.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 80 0 R
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/ActualText (Methodologies)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To conduct the tests, we utilized various tools and methods, including Mantis for bug tracking, Excel for documenting test cases and results, and Trello for task and workflow management. We performed functional, non-functional, confirmation, regression, and exploratory tests to ensure comprehensive system coverage.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 81 0 R
/Pg 10 0 R
>>
endobj
132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/ActualText (General Conclusions)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 298 0 R
/ActualText (Software Quality: The software has demonstrated acceptable quality in terms of stability and reliability, though several issues remain unresolved and need to be addressed. Regression testing conducted during each iteration confirmed that new implementations did not introduce problems in existing areas. However, some errors from earlier stages were not corrected.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 299 0 R
/ActualText (Functionality: Key system features, such as login and the registration of users, clients, pets, and vaccines, were thoroughly tested. While most functions operate as expected, several issues require attention, including data validation and consistency in the user interface.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
