137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/ActualText (Security: The system passed some security tests, but vulnerabilities were identified that need to be addressed.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
138 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/ActualText (Performance: Performance tests indicate that the system maintains acceptable response times, even under significant load conditions. Critical areas have been optimized to ensure a smooth user experience.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
