/T (1. Test Coverage Percentage: The team managed a total of 168 tests, distributed as follows: 73 regression tests, 15 confirmation tests, 40 functional tests, 34 non-functional tests, and 6 exploratory tests. Of these, 113 tests passed, 51 failed, and 4 remained blocked.)
