157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (4. Security Evolution: Due to the database connection issue, the planned critical vulnerability tests could not be performed. Therefore, it is not possible to determine the percentage reduction of critical vulnerabilities since the start of the project.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
