>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We would like to express our sincere gratitude to all the members of the development and testing teams, as well as all involved parties. Your dedication, effort, and collaboration have been fundamental to the progress and success of the project. We especially thank the developers for their tireless work in implementing functionalities and fixing errors, as well as the testing team for their meticulous attention to detail and commitment to quality. Without the collective effort of everyone, this project would not have been possible. Thank you all for your hard work and dedication!)
/Alt ()
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
