170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The project for the 'Guau Guau' Veterinary has been successfully completed. The developed software has undergone a rigorous testing process, ensuring that it meets quality and security standards.  We are confident that the final product will provide significant value and meet the expectations of our clients.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
